# Flatpak apps Vilna installs from its own Flatpak repository (remote "vilna",
# ADR 0024) on first boot, one id per line: Tinta Office (ADR 0011). Each one
# must have a pinned bundle in image/tinta-bundles.toml (checked in CI by
# tools/tinta_bundles.py).
io.github.stdenis1980.tintatexto
io.github.stdenis1980.tintacalculo
io.github.stdenis1980.tintapresenta
io.github.stdenis1980.tintapdf
io.github.stdenis1980.ibercorreo
